258 - Baptize Us Anew
 / 
Key: G
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 258
Topic: Holy Spirit - 

Verse 1:
[G]Bap[D7]tize [G]us anew With [C]power from on high,
[C]With [G]love, O [D7]re[G]fresh us! Dear [D]Savior, [G]draw [D]nigh.
[G]We [C]humbly beseech Thee, Lord [G]Jesus, we pray,
[G]With love and [G7]the [C]Spirit bap[G]tize us [D7]to[G]day.

Refrain:
[G]We humbly [D7]beseech Thee, [G]Lord Jesus, [C]we pray,
[C]With [G]love [D7]and [G]the [D]Spirit [G]baptize [D]us today.
[G]We praise Thee, [C]we bless Thee, dear [G]Lamb that was slain
[G]We [G7]laud [C]and adore [G]Thee, [D7]Amen [G]and Amen.

Verse 2:
[G]Unworthy [D7]we [G]cry, [C]Unholy, unclean,
[C]O [G]wash [D7]us and [G]cleanse [D]us From [G]sin's [D]guilty stain.

Verse 3:
[G]O [D7]heavenly Dove, [G]Descend from [C]on high!
[C]We [G]plead [D7]Thy [G]rich blessing; [D]In [G]mercy [D]draw nigh.

Verse 4:
[G]O list [D7]the glad [G]voice! From [C]heaven it came:
[C]Thou [G]art [D7]My [G]beloved, [D]Well [G]pleased [D]I am.
